<view class="screen"><view class="eyebrow">我的订单</view><view class="title">每一份计划，<text>{{'\n'}}</text>都有记录。</view><view wx:if="{{!vm.orders.length && !vm.pendingOrderId}}" class="empty">暂无订单。免费评估后可先预览个人计划。</view><view wx:for="{{vm.orders}}" wx:key="id" class="order"><view class="section-title"><text>{{item.title || '7 天薄肌启动挑战'}}</text><text>¥{{item.amount / 100}}</text></view><text class="small muted" user-select="true">订单号：{{item.id}}</text><view class="tag">{{item.status==='paid'?'已支付':item.status==='refunded'?'已退款':item.status==='closed'?'已关闭':'待支付或确认中'}}</view><button wx:if="{{item.status==='pending' || item.status==='confirming'}}" class="secondary" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="query" loading="{{busy}}">查询原订单状态</button><navigator wx:if="{{item.status==='pending' && item.sku}}" class="link" url="/pages/preview/index?sku={{item.sku}}" hover-class="navigator-hover">继续购买（恢复原订单）</navigator></view><button wx:if="{{vm.pendingOrderId}}" class="secondary" data-id="{{vm.pendingOrderId}}" bindtap="query" loading="{{busy}}">查询最近待确认订单</button><view class="body-copy">新指导套餐付款成功起算，手动续购；旧 7 天挑战仍按原权益执行。付款结果确认前不会解锁训练，请查询原订单，不必重复购买。</view><navigator wx:if="{{vm.entitlement || vm.isMember}}" class="primary" url="/pages/plan/index" hover-class="navigator-hover">查看我的计划</navigator><button wx:if="{{vm.entitlement}}" class="secondary" bindtap="subscribe">自愿开启任务提醒</button><button class="contact" open-type="contact" binderror="contactError">联系客服 · 订单与退款咨询</button><view class="fine">苹果平台退款按 苹果 实际提供的购买记录流程申请；本产品不提供自助退款按钮。</view></view>
